 glish ——\nGym B\, light (65 min)\nWarm-up (20 min):\n• Easy row or s
 ki: 5 min\n• World's greatest stretch: 5/side\n• 90/90 hip switches: 8
 /side\n• Band pull-apart 15 + no-money external rotation 12\n• Prone Y
 -raise: 2 x 12\n• Pogo hops: 2 x 20\n• Ramp-up sets of the first lift:
  2–3\n\nMain work (30 min\, light\, 2 sets):\n1. Box jumps: 3 x 3\, stic
 k every landing\, 60 s rest\n2. Front squat: 2 x 3 at normal weight\, 3 re
