 est\n4. Bulgarian split squat: 2 x 8 each\, 90 s rest\n5. Single-leg RDL t
 o press: 2 x 8 each\, 60 s rest\n6. Leg extension\, seat reclined: 2 x 12\
 n7. Standing barbell calf raise: 2 x 10\n\nSkip today: deadlift and Nordic
 s\n\nFunctional (10 min): wall balls EMOM 8 min\, 15 per minute\n\nEvening
